,     101463259:2V.@topic.@pl)<br />man(200618451:36.@entry,     600000241:02)<br />aoj(600000024:12,     100039021:0Q)<br />aoj(303161143:2L,     101463259:2V.@topic.@pl)<br />and:01(104362025:28.@entry.@def,     108499057:1E.@def)<br />qua(101463259:2V.@topic.@pl,     &quot;2&quot;:2H)<br />obj(600000024:12,     :01)<br />obj(200618451:36.@entry,     101463259:2V.@topic.@pl)<br />obj(200618451:36.@entry,     101463259:2V.@topic.@pl)<br />mod(100039021:0Q,     104616916:0D.@def)<br />obj(600000241:02,     100039021:0Q)<br />aoj:01(302349604:1X,     104362025:28.@entry.@def)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:3721]<br />{org:en}<br />the boundary layer and the free atmosphere (see Section 1.1).<br />{/org}<br />{unl}<br />and(108499057:0Y.@entry.@def,     101463259:0F.@def)<br />mod:02(104164989:1E,     &quot;1.1&quot;:1M)<br />and(108499057:0Y.@entry.@def,     101463259:0F.@def)<br />mod:02(104164989:1E,     &quot;1.1&quot;:1M)<br />mod(101463259:0F.@def,     108512259:06)<br />aoj(300916199:0T,     108499057:0Y.@entry.@def)<br />aoj(300916199:0T,     108499057:0Y.@entry.@def)<br />[W]<br />:02.@entry.@parenthesis<br />[/W]<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:3722]<br />{org:en}<br />Another surface layer is identified within the boundary layer, covering the lowest several tens of meters, this layer being in direct contact with the surface.<br />{/org}<br />{unl}<br />obj(200618451:0R.@entry,     101463259:0I.@topic)<br />qua(115691007:2L.@def,     600000059:2D)<br />mod(101463259:0I.@topic,     104362025:0A)<br />aoj(300005473:3L,     100039297:3S.@state)<br />mod(101463259:1M.@def,     108512259:1D)<br />mod(101463259:36.@entry,     600000017:31)<br />obj(200618451:0R.@entry,     101463259:0I.@topic)<br />qua(115691007:2L.@def,     600000059:2D)<br />mod(101463259:0I.@topic,     104362025:0A)<br />aoj(300005473:3L,     100039297:3S.@state)<br />mod(101463259:1M.@def,     108512259:1D)<br />mod(101463259:36.@entry,     600000017:31)<br />qua(103753077:2T.@pl,    