 />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:11812]<br />{org:en}<br />Such actions then rather play in the hands of growing inequalities.<br />{/org}<br />{unl}<br />man(200013328:0R.@entry,     400117620:0F)<br />mod(104752221:1K.@pl,     303070879:1C)<br />man(200013328:0R.@entry,     600000114:0K)<br />man(200013328:0R.@entry,     400117620:0F)<br />mod(104752221:1K.@pl,     303070879:1C)<br />man(200013328:0R.@entry,     600000114:0K)<br />plc(200013328:0R.@entry,     101208460:13.@def.@pl)<br />agt(200013328:0R.@entry,     100037396:07.@topic.@pl)<br />mod(100037396:07.@topic.@pl,     600001411:02)<br />mod(100037396:07.@topic.@pl,     600001411:02)<br />mod(101208460:13.@def.@pl,     104752221:1K.@pl)<br />{/unl}<br />[/S]<br /><br />[S:11813]<br />{org:en}<br />Although neo-liberal thinkers assume that a market-based approach and issues of equity are compatible, the market does not ensure equitable distribution of water.<br />{/org}<br />{unl}<br />con(202774184:3H.@entry.@emphasis.@not,     600000038:02)<br />mod:01(101060234:20.@entry.@pl,     113333420:2A)<br />obj(600000038:02,     200524682:0W)<br />obj(101083077:3Y,     107935504:4E)<br />mod(110708292:0N.@pl,     301536276:0B)<br />con(202774184:3H.@entry.@emphasis.@not,     600000038:02)<br />mod:01(101060234:20.@entry.@pl,     113333420:2A)<br />obj(600000038:02,     200524682:0W)<br />obj(101083077:3Y,     107935504:4E)<br />mod(110708292:0N.@pl,     301536276:0B)<br />aoj(300507464:2L,     :01)<br />obj(202774184:3H.@entry.@emphasis.@not,     101083077:3Y)<br />obj:01(302126140:1H,     101097292:1A)<br />obj(200524682:0W,     300507464:2L)<br />agt(202774184:3H.@entry.@emphasis.@not,     101097292:31.@topic.@def)<br />aoj:01(302126140:1H,     100280853:1N)<br />agt(200524682:0W,     110708292:0N.@pl)<br />aoj:01(302126140:1H,     100280853:1N)<br />agt(200524682:0W,     110708292:0N.@pl)<br />aoj(300958151:3O,     101083077:3Y)<br />mod(110708292:0N.@pl,     300575230:0F)<br />and:01(101060234:20.@entry.@pl,